      "title": "亮点；最精彩的部分（名词）",
      "meaning": "事件中最精彩、最重要或最有趣的部分。",
      "usageNote": "可数名词；the highlight of 后接活动或事件。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "s1-e1",
          "senseId": "s1",
          "en": "The lake was the highlight of the trip.",
          "zh": "湖泊是旅途中最精彩的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": "s1-e2",
          "senseId": "s1",
          "en": "The concert was a highlight of the festival.",
          "zh": "音乐会是这次节庆活动的亮点。"
        }
      ],
      "patterns": [],
